    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RocketPool</strong> is the ultimate mash-up of pool and rocketry! Grab your friends for a fast-paced, local-multiplayer party game where the classic rules of pool meet the chaotic fun of rocket-powered cue balls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475010/extras/685e4f86e080e39efc9bd17849c9917b.poster.avif?t=1740724687\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475010/extras/685e4f86e080e39efc9bd17849c9917b.webm?t=1740724687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475010/extras/685e4f86e080e39efc9bd17849c9917b.mp4?t=1740724687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Explosive Fun</strong><br>Aim, boost, and pocket your balls first in this high-energy twist on pool. Use your rocket to outmanoeuvre your opponents and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475010/extras/e8ee39a5f66f5bfb526672c6cf735eb8.poster.avif?t=1740724687\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475010/extras/e8ee39a5f66f5bfb526672c6cf735eb8.webm?t=1740724687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475010/extras/e8ee39a5f66f5bfb526672c6cf735eb8.mp4?t=1740724687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Details, Chaotic Gameplay</strong><br>Feel the burn <i>literally</i> as your rockets scorch the table felt. Watch sparks fly and smoke trail as your cue ball rockets across the table in stunning detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Gameplay, Modern Twist</strong><br>Compete with up to four players in a nostalgic last-century bar setting, brought to life with a chalkboard aesthetic. Whether you're aiming for precision or chaos, there's always room for skilful play and hilarious moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get in the Game Early</strong><br>Try the free demo, available in February. Play Classic mode for free and look forward to more game modes and features soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RocketPool</strong> is the ultimate mash-up of pool and rocketry! Grab your friends for a fast-paced, local-multiplayer party game where the classic rules of pool meet the chaotic fun of rocket-powered cue balls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475010/extras/685e4f86e080e39efc9bd17849c9917b.poster.avif?t=1740724687\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475010/extras/685e4f86e080e39efc9bd17849c9917b.webm?t=1740724687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475010/extras/685e4f86e080e39efc9bd17849c9917b.mp4?t=1740724687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Explosive Fun</strong><br>Aim, boost, and pocket your balls first in this high-energy twist on pool. Use your rocket to outmanoeuvre your opponents and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475010/extras/e8ee39a5f66f5bfb526672c6cf735eb8.poster.avif?t=1740724687\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475010/extras/e8ee39a5f66f5bfb526672c6cf735eb8.webm?t=1740724687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475010/extras/e8ee39a5f66f5bfb526672c6cf735eb8.mp4?t=1740724687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Details, Chaotic Gameplay</strong><br>Feel the burn <i>literally</i> as your rockets scorch the table felt. Watch sparks fly and smoke trail as your cue ball rockets across the table in stunning detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Gameplay, Modern Twist</strong><br>Compete with up to four players in a nostalgic last-century bar setting, brought to life with a chalkboard aesthetic. Whether you're aiming for precision or chaos, there's always room for skilful play and hilarious moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get in the Game Early</strong><br>Try the free demo, available in February. Play Classic mode for free and look forward to more game modes and features soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "RocketPool is a casual, local-multiplayer party game where each player controls a rocket-powered cue ball to pocket their balls first. It's pool... with rockets!",
